'''Junior God of Light - Valkyrie''' (光の神徒ヴァルキリー Hikari no shinto varukirī) is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Junior God of Light - Valkyrie
|appearance = [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 200.png
|money drop = 250円 - 987円
}}

==Enemy==
This is a ranged peon with very low health and HP, this enemy should barely be a problem for any cat army.

==Strategy==
Obviously, using [[Cat Units]] that have [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attack]] can deal with this enemy due to her being a constant peon for the collaboration. Reminder that she is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemy]] so cats that are [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating]] work well against her.

